<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending April 25 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, April 21</p>
<p>Premier Farnell Y   PFT	136.6	132.0-140.0 110.9</p>
<p>		   *    DIV	 12.0	 11.5-12.8   10.6</p>
<p>			  EPS	 29.3	 27.8-30.9   29.3</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT</p>
<p>consensus 137.0 Div 12.2 EPS 29.3)</p>
<p>TUESDAY, April 22</p>
<p>Smithkline Beecham 1Q   PFT	425.0	420.0-430.0 387.0</p>
<p>				DIV	  4.4	  4.2-4.4   4.0</p>
<p>				EPS	 10.2	 10.0-10.3  9.5</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, April 23</p>
<p>Bank of Scotland	Y    PFT	654.0	640.0-660.0 545.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	 8.15	  7.9-8.2   6.85</p>
<p>				   EPS	 30.5	 29.8-31.0 25.8</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT 659.0 Div 8.15 EPS 30.4)</p>
<p>THURSDAY, April 24</p>
<p>Ashley (Laura)	  Y    PFT	 15.5	 14.0-16.0 15.5</p>
<p>				   DIV	  1.4	  1.0-1.5   0.5</p>
<p>				   EPS	  4.5	  4.3-4.6   3.0 (Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT</p>
<p>16.0 Div 1.2 EPS 4.4)</p>
<p>ICI Plc		  1Q    PFT	 79.0	 75.0-90.0 202.0</p>
<p>* Figures adjusted for restructuring charge</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
